{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302310","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130231001:1":{"text":"분위기가 달아올라서 그런지 몸풀기 대결에서 다치는 사람이 많아졌어요.","source_cn":"只是最近因为气氛感召，预热切磋受伤的人数增加了不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A54BDB2A730540E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130231002:1":{"text":"문제라고 할 정도는 아니지만, 그래도 머리가 아프네요.","source_cn":"虽然没到出问题的地步，但也确实让我头疼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DBEAF4BC180167A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130231003:1":{"text":"그나마 다행인 건 그 친구들이 또 몸 하나는 튼튼해서 붕대만 감아줘도 웬만한 부상은 다 괜찮다는 점이에요...","source_cn":"不过好在那些好斗的家伙本身身体强壮，我只需要简单包扎一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x346B8EF123548878","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130231004:1":{"text":"아니었으면 저 혼자서는 환자들을 감당하지 못했을 거예요!","source_cn":"否则我一个人可忙不过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7964F165A5F4FFB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:医师莎特纳":{"text":"의사 샤트너","source":"医师莎特纳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}